# A polled system value notifies its listener only when the value changes (notes/signals.md "System values").
'use signals; polled_values.add(1); seen = 0; value_polled(1, () => 3, (value, old) => seen = value - old); seen'	2
'use signals; polled_values.add(1); seen = 0; value_polled(1, () => 1, (value, old) => seen = value - old); seen'	0
